                                "sense_id": "3fdea9d1-435b-3824-8a0e-1c45281cb3ce",
                                "text": "So strong is the barrier which these sea-borne sands oppose to the river-borne ooze, that as soon as a seabank is built — as the projectors of the Victoria County have built them — across any part of the estuary, the mud caught by it soon 'warps' the space within into firm and rich dry land."
